      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x}{x+y}+\\frac{y}{x+y}&=\\frac{x+y}{x+y}\\\\\\frac{x}{x+y}+\\frac{y}{x+y}&=1\\end{align*}$$\nTrue on the original domain $x+y\\ne0$.",
